# THE TRIGGER. 20.08 degrees about the pin at -1.561, 0.000, -0.510 (frame 1, fit 0.009). Sign checked: +20.08 lands the rest centroid 0.000 off frame 1; -20.08 misses by 1.380.
# the artist called this surface `Trigga`
part trigger
  role    = trigger
  surface = trigger
  dof
    kind    = hinge
    axis    = 0, 1, 0
    degrees = 20.08
    pivot   = -1.561, 0, -0.510
  end
end

# MEASURED: the underside is flat at z 1.69 from x 7.6 to 9.7; its middle. ESTIMATE: where the other hand goes.
part support
  role    = support
  subject = support
  grab       = 8.64, 0.02, 1.69
  grabradius = 3.0
end
